WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:15.652
cube floated through the stadium as the Battle Master spoke.

2
00:00:16.432 --> 00:00:18.613
"The next fighter doesn't look tough.

3
00:00:19.053 --> 00:00:23.214
But he likes to brag that he once defeated Heaven's entire army.

4
00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:28.995
I'm pleased to present Sun Wukong!"

5
00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:30.896
The audience cheered.

6
00:00:33.536 --> 00:00:34.636
Then the cubes vanished.

7
00:00:35.657 --> 00:00:37.997
Wukong faced his opponent, Glytar.

8
00:00:39.018 --> 00:00:40.918
A blue alien in the audience pointed.

9
00:00:40.938 --> 00:00:43.039
"It's a cute little monkey!"

10
00:00:43.519 --> 00:00:45.159
The audience erupted into laughter.

11
00:00:45.919 --> 00:00:47.400
Wukong glared at the crowd.

12
00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:53.221
Then he turned to Glytar, who was leaning on his ax and laughing.

13
00:00:53.241 --> 00:00:55.002
"What's so funny?"

14
00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:56.782
Glytar shrugged.

15
00:00:56.802 --> 00:00:58.723
"You're tiny."

16
00:00:58.743 --> 00:01:00.303
"That's true.

17
00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:02.624
I am small," Wukong said.

18
00:01:03.244 --> 00:01:05.625
"Maybe you should fight someone your own size."

19
00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:09.547
"Maybe." Glytar picked up his ax.

20
00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:12.568
"But you're the only one here right now."

21
00:01:13.749 --> 00:01:14.689
Wukong smiled.

22
00:01:14.709 --> 00:01:18.170
"I still think you should fight someone your own size.

23
00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:21.872
So He quickly grew big.

24
00:01:21.892 --> 00:01:25.433
"Whoa!" Glytar stepped back.

25
00:01:26.074 --> 00:01:27.734
Wukong swung his iron bar.

26
00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:29.655
Glytar jumped to avoid it.

27
00:01:30.095 --> 00:01:31.256
Wukong swung again.

28
00:01:31.872 --> 00:01:35.033
His bar came down fast, but Glytar rolled out of the way.

29
00:01:35.453 --> 00:01:37.994
Wham! The bar slammed into the ground.

30
00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:42.395
Slice! Wukong felt Glytar's ax brush over his head.

31
00:01:43.055 --> 00:01:44.816
Several of his hairs fell to the ground.

32
00:01:44.836 --> 00:01:47.056
"Hey!" Wukong yelled.

33
00:01:47.076 --> 00:01:49.277
"I didn't ask for a haircut!"

34
00:01:50.097 --> 00:01:51.337
Glytar twirled his ax.

35
00:01:51.357 --> 00:01:56.019
"Ha-ha!" Wukong picked up the hairs and recited a spell.

36
00:01:57.339 --> 00:01:58.579
Glytar lowered his ax.

37
00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:00.100
"What are you doing?"

38
00:02:00.972 --> 00:02:03.054
"A trick I learned a long time ago."

39
00:02:04.314 --> 00:02:07.296
Suddenly three small Wukongs charged toward Glytar.

40
00:02:07.317 --> 00:02:10.739
"Ahh!" The alien swung his ax wildly.

41
00:02:11.299 --> 00:02:13.081
The Wukongs punched and kicked.

42
00:02:13.881 --> 00:02:15.342
Glytar's ax hit one of them.

43
00:02:15.842 --> 00:02:20.946
Poof! That Wukong disappeared, but another Wukong yanked the ax from Glytar's hands.

44
00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:26.070
"Yikes!" Glytar ducked as the Wukong swung.

45
00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.372
Then he grabbed the ax and shook off the little Wukong.

46
00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:31.349
He brought the ax down hard.

47
00:02:31.809 --> 00:02:34.110
Poof! The little Wukong vanished.

48
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:37.051
Glytar stomped toward the third Wukong.

49
00:02:37.651 --> 00:02:40.272
Pow! Wukong swung his iron bar.

50
00:02:41.013 --> 00:02:44.474
Glytar flew into the crowd, crashing into the blue alien.

51
00:02:44.954 --> 00:02:46.955
The alien's drink spilled everywhere.

52
00:02:46.975 --> 00:02:48.616
"Oh man!"

53
00:02:49.756 --> 00:02:50.737
Wukong laughed.

54
00:02:52.157 --> 00:02:53.538
Glytar climbed to his feet.

55
00:02:53.558 --> 00:02:55.759
"I surrender!"

56
00:02:55.779 --> 00:02:59.160
"Sun Wukong wins!"

57
00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:00.940
the Battle Master said.

58
00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.441
The crowd cheered as Wukong took a bow.

59
00:03:03.961 --> 00:03:06.982
His cube reappeared and brought him back to the other cubes.

60
00:03:07.002 --> 00:03:09.523
"That was fun," Wukong thought.

61
00:03:09.543 --> 00:03:12.183
"But I really do need to get out of here.

62
00:03:12.764 --> 00:03:15.304
The Tang Monk needs—" "Wukong!"

63
00:03:15.684 --> 00:03:16.445
someone shouted.

64
00:03:16.925 --> 00:03:18.005
Wukong looked down.

65
00:03:18.905 --> 00:03:21.286
Rocket Girl and Kid Comet were in cubes below him.

66
00:03:21.786 --> 00:03:22.446
He gasped.

67
00:03:22.466 --> 00:03:24.207
"What are you two doing here?"

68
00:03:25.267 --> 00:03:26.087
Cozlin shrugged.

69
00:03:26.107 --> 00:03:27.988
"The same thing you're doing.

70
00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.241
The Battle Master captured us to make us fight."

71
00:03:31.261 --> 00:03:32.781
"We need to escape!"

72
00:03:33.121 --> 00:03:33.781
Roxy said.

73
00:03:34.562 --> 00:03:36.342
The Battle Master's voice boomed again.

74
00:03:36.362 --> 00:03:40.483
"Our next fighter comes from the planet Zentaria.

75
00:03:41.424 --> 00:03:46.105
Give a warm welcome to Nebulon!"

76
00:03:47.505 --> 00:03:50.066
A cube carried a warrior who was doing stretches.

77
00:03:50.706 --> 00:03:52.547
A sword and shield lay on the floor.

78
00:03:53.447 --> 00:03:55.807
Wukong laughed.

79
00:03:55.827 --> 00:03:57.608
"That guy's a joke!

80
00:03:58.016 --> 00:03:59.537
You two don't need to worry.

81
00:04:00.037 --> 00:04:02.739
I'll defeat everyone here, and then the three of us will leave."

82
00:04:02.759 --> 00:04:06.541
"We have bigger opponents to worry about," Roxy said.

83
00:04:06.561 --> 00:04:08.022
"Like who?"

84
00:04:08.423 --> 00:04:09.283
Wukong asked.

85
00:04:10.064 --> 00:04:10.824
Roxy pointed.

86
00:04:10.844 --> 00:04:14.046
"That!" Another cube floated out.

87
00:04:14.626 --> 00:04:16.167
It was much bigger than the others.

88
00:04:16.748 --> 00:04:18.929
A blast of flames filled it with smoke.

89
00:04:19.569 --> 00:04:23.052
When the smoke cleared, Wukong saw a large dragon inside!
